<title>BELGIUM: ASLK/CGER RAISES SAVINGS BOND RATES.</title>
<headline>ASLK/CGER RAISES SAVINGS BOND RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian ASLK/CGER Bank said on</p>
<p>Monday it would raise interest rates on its savings bonds from</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>    MATURITY	  NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>    one year	  3.00 pct	2.80 pct</p>
<p>    two years	 3.40 pct	3.10 pct</p>
<p>    three years     3.75 pct	3.50 pct</p>
<p>    four years	4.10 pct	3.90 pct</p>
<p>    five years	4.50 pct	4.30 pct</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
